      "skillOrderNotes": {
        "interleave": "Two-source rules (docs/research/2026-10-sorcerer-pack.md §4.2: mmo-codex [berdugz], daevaguides [couga54]): Flame Arrow, Ice Chain and Firestorm are the first point sinks, Blaze and Bittercold Wind next, Hellfire from when it is learned at 14. The first passive is not agreed (Absorb Essence for berdugz, Robe of Flame for couga54); the guide takes Metabot's targets, which leave Absorb Essence out. The order between those rules is inferred.",
        "budget": "Eight core skills, then Fire Mark (core: false, single source, so after every core skill), to Lv 10 = 9 × 21 = 189 points; Wish of Concentration to 7 = 9 (198), Frost to 5 = 5 (203). LEVEL_POINTS[45] = 203 (Metabot; aion2turkiye agrees) plus Wisdom Stones. Wish of Concentration to 10 (aion2turkiye, daevaguides) is the first place for points from quests and Sealed Dungeons (claim C44)."
      },
